      "writtenOn": "2026-11-11T20:26:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this should be emitted as a `float3` and we rely on the fragment shader division you added previously. If we divide in the vertex shader, it won\u0027t have perspective interpolation with respect to `localToDevice` since the vertex transform and W values are from `maskToDevice`.",
